{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_title", "source_sha256": "f71209241458cbd2521c2f131c21e37148ad6828656775eac9c7b134686c2fa3", "ja": "古からのこだわり", "zh": "自古以来的讲究", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9164e20a0a0ae1ac4c111be266821aa33e3e55b65bba07a66491fdc828212d1f", "ja": "仕事が終わり、夜の厳島神社を見学する\n美希、志保、風花。舞台を見てどんな演出が\nいいかを考え始めるプロデューサー。\nアイドル達は「暗くて危ないから」と\n思い思いに心配する。", "zh": "工作结束后，美希、志保和风花参观夜晚的严岛神社。制作人看着舞台，开始思考怎样的演出比较好。偶像们都以“天黑又危险”为由，各自担心起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "114ce94abc3cb989015294a3a8bc8d40c352226f3feeba61464e07bd84662ac0", "ja": "（仕事の終わりに、みんなで厳島神社にやってきた！\n夜だとより荘厳な雰囲気が感じられるな……）", "zh": "（工作结束后，大家一起来到了严岛神社！\n到了晚上，似乎更能感受到庄严的氛围……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "6264d73d6ea0be24174c80e23bdab87108b1dced57829e7359709281a31fe0cb", "ja": "ここって、文化遺産……だっけ？\n海に浮かぶ神社も舞台も、なんだか神秘的なの～。", "zh": "这里是文化遗产……来着？  \n漂浮在海上的神社和舞台，总觉得好神秘哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dabafe5dc4999d2719da219fc5092cdb8108a8cd84afc7534f589744fb7b6bca", "ja": "海上での音響効果を考えて、能舞台は床に工夫がある\nみたい。パンフレットの受け売りだけどね。", "zh": "听说，为了考虑海上的音响效果，能舞台的地板也经过了特别设计。虽然这些是我从宣传册上照搬来的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "8400a09e9be0548102dab2ace9a4de86a7ab1b43dd731432e5d8dd915de4ec43", "ja": "すごい……。舞台のための演出や工夫って、\nそんなに昔から考えられていることなんですね……。", "zh": "好厉害……原来为了舞台效果，早在那么久以前就已经开始考虑这些设计和巧思了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3c1209c2858760f6eba9125d19668e3041b79750dd4196f0e7d28da0fb901b73", "ja": "ライトアップも、すごく綺麗だね。\nこんなステージで歌えたら、素敵だろうな……♪", "zh": "灯光也很漂亮呢。\n要是能在这样的舞台上唱歌，一定很棒吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "34685a1b90e64266f052e3ced900bc470b4a7ec0d30594dedc6ddca530b6a44f", "ja": "ここでステージか……ふむ。\nだとしたら、どんな演出がいいか……。", "zh": "在这里搭建舞台吗……嗯。\n既然如此，该采用什么样的演出呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "4eeb0d92084cf7f8e39eca8d4662ed8b9049d005a36fa14a0b4ad396cc93dc0f", "ja": "考えごともいいですけど、転ばないでくださいね？\n足元、暗いですから。", "zh": "想事情是没关系，不过可别摔倒了？脚下很暗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "e6d16d8129d1f362e1ccb3b747c7759b240e804b4cd5ec318ecd8445d9324187", "ja": "それなら……ねえねえ、{$P$}？\n転ばないように、ミキと手をつなご♪", "zh": "那样的话……呐呐，{$P$}？\n为了不摔倒，和美希牵手吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "81673a71eaab29b55e18ff34b669557c91980f19a576b949a967bf864c1e7cbb", "ja": "えっ。そ、それは流石にちょっと……。", "zh": "诶。那、那也未免有点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "cdd95b5ade915a022b9ce6018dd06b3f357981227aa91d7b579ed87e3d39abfb", "ja": "……。{$P$}さん、\nなんだかちょっと、デレデレしてませんか？", "zh": "……。{$P$}先生，\n总觉得你是不是有点，嬉皮笑脸的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f53070d0bd2c549912e5608acb394db245ea5f5352d00052eb3978ebf74ac506", "ja": "もう……ダメですよ？　{$P$}さん。\n足元が不安なら、わ、私の腕につかまっても……。", "zh": "真是的……不可以这样哦？{$P$}先生。\n要是脚底下没站稳，抓、抓着我的胳膊也是可以的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "1e14d058c9a2f94b12a614d5595ea9a3e72086e41ad17d01aeac3b9d1c7b3798", "ja": "あっ、風花ズルいの～。{$P$}、\nミキにつかまってもいいからね？", "zh": "啊，风花太狡猾了～。{$P$}，\n抓着美希也可以的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d579751322d81f918d007339a93341e87cfae24b890903b2080a47be4b399adb", "ja": "（4人で、安全に配慮しつつ夜の厳島神社を堪能した。\nみんな楽しい時間を過ごせたみたいで、なによりだ！）", "zh": "（我们4人一边注意安全，一边尽情享受了夜晚的严岛神社。大家似乎都度过了一段快乐的时光，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
